<div class="toplang">
<p><span>Available Languages: </span><a href="../de/rewrite/remapping.html" hreflang="de" rel="alternate" title="Deutsch">&nbsp;de&nbsp;</a> |
<a href="../en/rewrite/remapping.html" title="English">&nbsp;en&nbsp;</a> |
